%% FlowMem | type=sequenceDiagram | layer=behavior | method=ai | refresh=none | last-updated=2026-05-03 %%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CC as Claude Code
    participant FM as FlowMem Skill
    participant Scripts as Extraction Scripts
    participant FS as File System

    Dev->>CC: "generate flowmem for this project"
    CC->>FM: Invoke SKILL.md

    Note over FM: Phase 1 — Classify
    FM->>FS: Read README, src/ tree
    FS-->>FM: Project structure

    Note over FM: Phase 2 — Extract
    FM->>Scripts: Run scan_ast.py
    Scripts-->>FM: ast.json (classes, functions)
    FM->>Scripts: Run scan_todos.py
    Scripts-->>FM: todos.json (debt map)
    FM->>Scripts: Run scan_git.sh
    Scripts-->>FM: git.txt (history)

    Note over FM: Phase 3 — Chart
    FM->>FS: Write .mmd files to .flowmem/charts/

    Note over FM: Phase 4 — Index
    FM->>FS: Write INDEX.md + TRAVERSE.md

    FM-->>CC: "Generated N charts in X layers"
    CC-->>Dev: Summary + how-to-view
